#: ../../library/shutil.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!shutil` --- High-level file operations"
msgstr ":mod:`!shutil` — 高階檔案操作"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/shutil.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/shutil.py`"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:15
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!shutil` module offers a number of high-level operations on files "
"and collections of files.  In particular, functions are provided  which "
"support file copying and removal. For operations on individual files, see "
"also the :mod:`os` module."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!shutil` 模組提供了一些針對檔案與檔案集合的高階操作，特別是提供了支援檔"
"案複製與刪除的函式。關於個別檔案的操作，另請參閱 :mod:`os` 模組。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:22
msgid ""
"Even the higher-level file copying functions (:func:`shutil.copy`, :func:"
"`shutil.copy2`) cannot copy all file metadata."
msgstr ""
"即使是較高階的檔案複製函式（:func:`shutil.copy`、:func:`shutil.copy2`）也無法"
"複製所有的檔案詮釋資料。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:25
msgid ""
"On POSIX platforms, this means that file owner and group are lost as well as "
"ACLs.  On Mac OS, the resource fork and other metadata are not used. This "
"means that resources will be lost and file type and creator codes will not "
"be correct. On Windows, file owners, ACLs and alternate data streams are not "
"copied."
msgstr ""
"在 POSIX 平台上，這代表檔案擁有者與群組以及 ACL 都會遺失。在 Mac OS 上，資源"
"分支 (resource fork) 與其他詮釋資料不會被使用，這代表資源會遺失，且檔案類型與"
"建立者碼 (creator code) 將不正確。在 Windows 上，檔案擁有者、ACL 與替代資料"
"流 (alternate data stream) 都不會被複製。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:35
msgid "Directory and files operations"
msgstr "目錄和檔案操作"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:39
msgid ""
"Copy the contents of the :term:`file-like object <file object>` *fsrc* to "
"the file-like object *fdst*. The integer *length*, if given, is the buffer "
"size. In particular, a negative *length* value means to copy the data "
"without looping over the source data in chunks; by default the data is read "
"in chunks to avoid uncontrolled memory consumption. Note that if the current "
"file position of the *fsrc* object is not 0, only the contents from the "
"current file position to the end of the file will be copied."
msgstr ""
"將\\ :term:`類檔案物件 <file object>` *fsrc* 的內容複製到類檔案物件 *fdst*。"
"整數 *length* 若有給定則為緩衝區大小。特別是，負的 *length* 值代表直接複製資"
"料，而不以區塊 (chunk) 為單位迴圈讀取來源資料；預設情況下會以區塊讀取資料，以"
"避免無法控制的記憶體消耗。請注意，如果 *fsrc* 物件目前的檔案位置不是 0，則只"
"會複製從目前檔案位置到檔案結尾的內容。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:47
msgid ""
":func:`copyfileobj` will *not* guarantee that the destination stream has "
"been flushed on completion of the copy. If you want to read from the "
"destination at the completion of the copy operation (for example, reading "
"the contents of a temporary file that has been copied from a HTTP stream), "
"you must ensure that you have called :func:`~io.IOBase.flush` or :func:`~io."
"IOBase.close` on the file-like object before attempting to read the "
"destination file."
msgstr ""
":func:`copyfileobj` *不會*\\ 保證目的串流在複製完成時已被排清 (flush)。如果你"
"想在複製操作完成時從目的地讀取（例如讀取從 HTTP 串流複製而來的暫存檔內容），"
"你必須確保在嘗試讀取目的檔案之前，已經對該類檔案物件呼叫了 :func:`~io.IOBase."
"flush` 或 :func:`~io.IOBase.close`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:57
msgid ""
"Copy the contents (no metadata) of the file named *src* to a file named "
"*dst* and return *dst* in the most efficient way possible. *src* and *dst* "
"are :term:`path-like objects <path-like object>` or path names given as "
"strings."
msgstr ""
"以最有效率的方式，將名為 *src* 的檔案內容（不含詮釋資料）複製到名為 *dst* 的"
"檔案並回傳 *dst*。*src* 與 *dst* 為\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like "
"object>`\\ 或以字串給定的路徑名稱。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:61
msgid ""
"*dst* must be the complete target file name; look at :func:`~shutil.copy` "
"for a copy that accepts a target directory path.  If *src* and *dst* specify "
"the same file, :exc:`SameFileError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"*dst* 必須是完整的目標檔案名稱；如需接受目標目錄路徑的複製方式，請參考 :func:"
"`~shutil.copy`。如果 *src* 與 *dst* 指定的是同一個檔案，則會引發 :exc:"
"`SameFileError`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:65
msgid ""
"The destination location must be writable; otherwise, an :exc:`OSError` "
"exception will be raised. If *dst* already exists, it will be replaced. "
"Special files such as character or block devices and pipes cannot be copied "
"with this function."
msgstr ""
"目的位置必須是可寫入的，否則會引發 :exc:`OSError` 例外。如果 *dst* 已經存在，"
"它將被取代。字元裝置、區塊裝置與管道等特殊檔案無法使用此函式複製。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:70
msgid ""
"If *follow_symlinks* is false and *src* is a symbolic link, a new symbolic "
"link will be created instead of copying the file *src* points to."
msgstr ""
"如果 *follow_symlinks* 為 false 且 *src* 是符號連結，則會建立一個新的符號連"
"結，而不是複製 *src* 所指向的檔案。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:74 ../../library/shutil.rst:188
#: ../../library/shutil.rst:219
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.copyfile`` with "
"arguments ``src``, ``dst``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``src``、``dst`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil."
"copyfile``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:76
msgid ""
":exc:`IOError` used to be raised instead of :exc:`OSError`. Added "
"*follow_symlinks* argument. Now returns *dst*."
msgstr ""
"以前會引發 :exc:`IOError` 而不是 :exc:`OSError`。新增 *follow_symlinks* 引"
"數。現在會回傳 *dst*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:81
msgid ""
"Raise :exc:`SameFileError` instead of :exc:`Error`.  Since the former is a "
"subclass of the latter, this change is backward compatible."
msgstr ""
"改為引發 :exc:`SameFileError` 而非 :exc:`Error`。由於前者是後者的子類別，此變"
"更是向後相容的。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:85 ../../library/shutil.rst:196
#: ../../library/shutil.rst:228 ../../library/shutil.rst:298
#: ../../library/shutil.rst:421
msgid ""
"Platform-specific fast-copy syscalls may be used internally in order to copy "
"the file more efficiently. See :ref:`shutil-platform-dependent-efficient-"
"copy-operations` section."
msgstr ""
"內部可能會使用平台特定的快速複製 (fast-copy) 系統呼叫，以更有效率地複製檔案。"
"請參閱\\ :ref:`shutil-platform-dependent-efficient-copy-operations`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:92
msgid ""
"This exception is raised when :func:`copyfile` or :func:`copytree` attempt "
"to copy a named pipe."
msgstr ""
"當 :func:`copyfile` 或 :func:`copytree` 嘗試複製具名管道時會引發此例外。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:99
msgid ""
"This exception is raised if source and destination in :func:`copyfile` are "
"the same file."
msgstr "如果 :func:`copyfile` 中的來源與目的地是同一個檔案，則會引發此例外。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:107
msgid ""
"Copy the permission bits from *src* to *dst*.  The file contents, owner, and "
"group are unaffected.  *src* and *dst* are :term:`path-like objects <path-"
"like object>` or path names given as strings. If *follow_symlinks* is false, "
"and both *src* and *dst* are symbolic links, :func:`copymode` will attempt "
"to modify the mode of *dst* itself (rather than the file it points to).  "
"This functionality is not available on every platform; please see :func:"
"`copystat` for more information.  If :func:`copymode` cannot modify symbolic "
"links on the local platform, and it is asked to do so, it will do nothing "
"and return."
msgstr ""
"將權限位元從 *src* 複製到 *dst*。檔案內容、擁有者與群組不受影響。*src* 與 "
"*dst* 為\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`\\ 或以字串給定的路徑名稱。如"
"果 *follow_symlinks* 為 false，且 *src* 與 *dst* 都是符號連結，:func:"
"`copymode` 會嘗試修改 *dst* 本身的模式（而不是它所指向的檔案）。此功能並非在"
"每個平台上都可用；更多資訊請參閱 :func:`copystat`。如果 :func:`copymode` 無法"
"在本機平台上修改符號連結，而又被要求這麼做，它將不做任何事並直接回傳。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:117 ../../library/shutil.rst:190
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.copymode`` with "
"arguments ``src``, ``dst``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``src``、``dst`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil."
"copymode``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:119
msgid "Added *follow_symlinks* argument."
msgstr "新增 *follow_symlinks* 引數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:124
msgid ""
"Copy the permission bits, last access time, last modification time, and "
"flags from *src* to *dst*.  On Linux, :func:`copystat` also copies the "
"\"extended attributes\" where possible.  The file contents, owner, and group "
"are unaffected.  *src* and *dst* are :term:`path-like objects <path-like "
"object>` or path names given as strings."
msgstr ""
"將權限位元、最後存取時間、最後修改時間與旗標從 *src* 複製到 *dst*。在 Linux "
"上，:func:`copystat` 也會在可能的情況下複製「延伸屬性」。檔案內容、擁有者與群"
"組不受影響。*src* 與 *dst* 為\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`\\ 或以"
"字串給定的路徑名稱。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:130
msgid ""
"If *follow_symlinks* is false, and *src* and *dst* both refer to symbolic "
"links, :func:`copystat` will operate on the symbolic links themselves rather "
"than the files the symbolic links refer to—reading the information from the "
"*src* symbolic link, and writing the information to the *dst* symbolic link."
msgstr ""
"如果 *follow_symlinks* 為 false，且 *src* 與 *dst* 都是符號連結，:func:"
"`copystat` 將對符號連結本身進行操作，而不是對符號連結所指向的檔案：從 *src* "
"符號連結讀取資訊，並將資訊寫入 *dst* 符號連結。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:139
msgid ""
"Not all platforms provide the ability to examine and modify symbolic links.  "
"Python itself can tell you what functionality is locally available."
msgstr ""
"並非所有平台都提供檢查與修改符號連結的能力。Python 本身可以告訴你本機有哪些功"
"能可用。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:143
msgid ""
"If ``os.chmod in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` is ``True``, :func:`copystat` "
"can modify the permission bits of a symbolic link."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``os.chmod in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` 為 ``True``，:func:"
"`copystat` 可以修改符號連結的權限位元。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:147
msgid ""
"If ``os.utime in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` is ``True``, :func:`copystat` "
"can modify the last access and modification times of a symbolic link."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``os.utime in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` 為 ``True``，:func:"
"`copystat` 可以修改符號連結的最後存取時間與修改時間。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:151
msgid ""
"If ``os.chflags in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` is ``True``, :func:"
"`copystat` can modify the flags of a symbolic link.  (``os.chflags`` is not "
"available on all platforms.)"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``os.chflags in os.supports_follow_symlinks`` 為 ``True``，:func:"
"`copystat` 可以修改符號連結的旗標。（``os.chflags`` 並非在所有平台上都可"
"用。）"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:156
msgid ""
"On platforms where some or all of this functionality is unavailable, when "
"asked to modify a symbolic link, :func:`copystat` will copy everything it "
"can. :func:`copystat` never returns failure."
msgstr ""
"在部分或全部這些功能無法使用的平台上，當被要求修改符號連結時，:func:"
"`copystat` 會複製所有它能複製的內容。:func:`copystat` 永遠不會回傳失敗。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:161
msgid "Please see :data:`os.supports_follow_symlinks` for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 :data:`os.supports_follow_symlinks`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:164 ../../library/shutil.rst:221
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.copystat`` with "
"arguments ``src``, ``dst``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``src``、``dst`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil."
"copystat``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:166
msgid ""
"Added *follow_symlinks* argument and support for Linux extended attributes."
msgstr "新增 *follow_symlinks* 引數以及對 Linux 延伸屬性的支援。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:171
msgid ""
"Copies the file *src* to the file or directory *dst*.  *src* and *dst* "
"should be :term:`path-like objects <path-like object>` or strings.  If *dst* "
"specifies a directory, the file will be copied into *dst* using the base "
"filename from *src*. If *dst* specifies a file that already exists, it will "
"be replaced. Returns the path to the newly created file."
msgstr ""
"將檔案 *src* 複製到檔案或目錄 *dst*。*src* 與 *dst* 應為\\ :term:`類路徑物件 "
"<path-like object>`\\ 或字串。如果 *dst* 指定的是目錄，檔案將使用 *src* 的基"
"本檔案名稱複製到 *dst* 中。如果 *dst* 指定的是已存在的檔案，它將被取代。回傳"
"新建立檔案的路徑。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:177
msgid ""
"If *follow_symlinks* is false, and *src* is a symbolic link, *dst* will be "
"created as a symbolic link.  If *follow_symlinks* is true and *src* is a "
"symbolic link, *dst* will be a copy of the file *src* refers to."
msgstr ""
"如果 *follow_symlinks* 為 false 且 *src* 是符號連結，*dst* 將被建立為符號連"
"結。如果 *follow_symlinks* 為 true 且 *src* 是符號連結，*dst* 將會是 *src* 所"
"指向檔案的副本。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:182
msgid ""
":func:`~shutil.copy` copies the file data and the file's permission mode "
"(see :func:`os.chmod`).  Other metadata, like the file's creation and "
"modification times, is not preserved. To preserve all file metadata from the "
"original, use :func:`~shutil.copy2` instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`~shutil.copy` 會複製檔案資料與檔案的權限模式（請參閱 :func:`os."
"chmod`）。其他詮釋資料，例如檔案的建立與修改時間，則不會保留。若要保留原始檔"
"案的所有詮釋資料，請改用 :func:`~shutil.copy2`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:192
msgid ""
"Added *follow_symlinks* argument. Now returns path to the newly created file."
msgstr "新增 *follow_symlinks* 引數。現在會回傳新建立檔案的路徑。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:203
msgid ""
"Identical to :func:`~shutil.copy` except that :func:`copy2` also attempts to "
"preserve file metadata."
msgstr ""
"與 :func:`~shutil.copy` 相同，差別在於 :func:`copy2` 還會嘗試保留檔案詮釋資"
"料。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:206
msgid ""
"When *follow_symlinks* is false, and *src* is a symbolic link, :func:`copy2` "
"attempts to copy all metadata from the *src* symbolic link to the newly "
"created *dst* symbolic link. However, this functionality is not available on "
"all platforms. On platforms where some or all of this functionality is "
"unavailable, :func:`copy2` will preserve all the metadata it can; :func:"
"`copy2` never raises an exception because it cannot preserve file metadata."
msgstr ""
"當 *follow_symlinks* 為 false 且 *src* 是符號連結時，:func:`copy2` 會嘗試將 "
"*src* 符號連結的所有詮釋資料複製到新建立的 *dst* 符號連結。然而，此功能並非在"
"所有平台上都可用。在部分或全部此功能無法使用的平台上，:func:`copy2` 會盡可能"
"保留所有詮釋資料；:func:`copy2` 永遠不會因為無法保留檔案詮釋資料而引發例外。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:215
msgid ""
":func:`copy2` uses :func:`copystat` to copy the file metadata. Please see :"
"func:`copystat` for more information about platform support for modifying "
"symbolic link metadata."
msgstr ""
":func:`copy2` 使用 :func:`copystat` 來複製檔案詮釋資料。關於修改符號連結詮釋"
"資料的平台支援，更多資訊請參閱 :func:`copystat`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:223
msgid ""
"Added *follow_symlinks* argument, try to copy extended file system "
"attributes too (currently Linux only). Now returns path to the newly created "
"file."
msgstr ""
"新增 *follow_symlinks* 引數，並嘗試一併複製延伸檔案系統屬性（目前僅限 "
"Linux）。現在會回傳新建立檔案的路徑。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:235
msgid ""
"This factory function creates a function that can be used as a callable for :"
"func:`copytree`\\'s *ignore* argument, ignoring files and directories that "
"match one of the glob-style *patterns* provided.  See the example below."
msgstr ""
"這個工廠函式會建立一個函式，可作為 :func:`copytree` 的 *ignore* 引數所用的可"
"呼叫物件，忽略符合所提供之任一 glob 風格 *patterns* 的檔案與目錄。請參閱下方"
"範例。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:244
msgid ""
"Recursively copy an entire directory tree rooted at *src* to a directory "
"named *dst* and return the destination directory.  All intermediate "
"directories needed to contain *dst* will also be created by default."
msgstr ""
"遞迴地將以 *src* 為根的整個目錄樹複製到名為 *dst* 的目錄，並回傳目的目錄。預"
"設情況下，也會建立容納 *dst* 所需的所有中間目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:248
msgid ""
"Permissions and times of directories are copied with :func:`copystat`, "
"individual files are copied using :func:`~shutil.copy2`."
msgstr ""
"目錄的權限與時間會以 :func:`copystat` 複製，個別檔案則使用 :func:`~shutil."
"copy2` 複製。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:251
msgid ""
"If *symlinks* is true, symbolic links in the source tree are represented as "
"symbolic links in the new tree and the metadata of the original links will "
"be copied as far as the platform allows; if false or omitted, the contents "
"and metadata of the linked files are copied to the new tree."
msgstr ""
"如果 *symlinks* 為 true，來源樹中的符號連結在新樹中會以符號連結表示，且會在平"
"台允許的範圍內複製原始連結的詮釋資料；如果為 false 或省略，則會將被連結檔案的"
"內容與詮釋資料複製到新樹中。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:256
msgid ""
"When *symlinks* is false, if the file pointed to by the symlink doesn't "
"exist, an exception will be added in the list of errors raised in an :exc:"
"`Error` exception at the end of the copy process. You can set the optional "
"*ignore_dangling_symlinks* flag to true if you want to silence this "
"exception. Notice that this option has no effect on platforms that don't "
"support :func:`os.symlink`."
msgstr ""
"當 *symlinks* 為 false 時，如果符號連結所指向的檔案不存在，會將一個例外加入錯"
"誤串列，並在複製過程結束時隨 :exc:`Error` 例外一併引發。如果你想抑制此例外，"
"可以將可選的 *ignore_dangling_symlinks* 旗標設為 true。請注意，此選項在不支"
"援 :func:`os.symlink` 的平台上沒有作用。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:263
msgid ""
"If *ignore* is given, it must be a callable that will receive as its "
"arguments the directory being visited by :func:`copytree`, and a list of its "
"contents, as returned by :func:`os.listdir`.  Since :func:`copytree` is "
"called recursively, the *ignore* callable will be called once for each "
"directory that is copied.  The callable must return a sequence of directory "
"and file names relative to the current directory (i.e. a subset of the items "
"in its second argument); these names will then be ignored in the copy "
"process.  :func:`ignore_patterns` can be used to create such a callable that "
"ignores names based on glob-style patterns."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定 *ignore*，它必須是一個可呼叫物件，會接收 :func:`copytree` 正在走訪"
"的目錄，以及該目錄內容的串列（即 :func:`os.listdir` 的回傳值）作為引數。由"
"於 :func:`copytree` 會被遞迴呼叫，因此每個被複製的目錄都會呼叫一次 *ignore* "
"可呼叫物件。該可呼叫物件必須回傳相對於目前目錄的目錄與檔案名稱序列（即其第二"
"個引數中項目的子集）；這些名稱將在複製過程中被忽略。可以使用 :func:"
"`ignore_patterns` 來建立這樣一個根據 glob 風格模式忽略名稱的可呼叫物件。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:273
msgid ""
"If exception(s) occur, an :exc:`Error` is raised with a list of reasons."
msgstr "如果發生例外，會引發附帶原因串列的 :exc:`Error`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:275
msgid ""
"If *copy_function* is given, it must be a callable that will be used to copy "
"each file. It will be called with the source path and the destination path "
"as arguments. By default, :func:`~shutil.copy2` is used, but any function "
"that supports the same signature (like :func:`~shutil.copy`) can be used."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定 *copy_function*，它必須是用來複製每個檔案的可呼叫物件。它會以來源"
"路徑與目的路徑作為引數被呼叫。預設使用 :func:`~shutil.copy2`，但任何支援相同"
"簽名的函式（例如 :func:`~shutil.copy`）都可以使用。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:280
msgid ""
"If *dirs_exist_ok* is false (the default) and *dst* already exists, a :exc:"
"`FileExistsError` is raised. If *dirs_exist_ok* is true, the copying "
"operation will continue if it encounters existing directories, and files "
"within the *dst* tree will be overwritten by corresponding files from the "
"*src* tree."
msgstr ""
"如果 *dirs_exist_ok* 為 false（預設值）且 *dst* 已經存在，則會引發 :exc:"
"`FileExistsError`。如果 *dirs_exist_ok* 為 true，複製操作遇到已存在的目錄時會"
"繼續進行，且 *dst* 樹中的檔案會被 *src* 樹中對應的檔案覆寫。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:286
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.copytree`` with "
"arguments ``src``, ``dst``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``src``、``dst`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil."
"copytree``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:288
msgid ""
"Added the *copy_function* argument to be able to provide a custom copy "
"function. Added the *ignore_dangling_symlinks* argument to silence dangling "
"symlinks errors when *symlinks* is false."
msgstr ""
"新增 *copy_function* 引數，以便能提供自訂的複製函式。新增 "
"*ignore_dangling_symlinks* 引數，以在 *symlinks* 為 false 時抑制迷途符號連結 "
"(dangling symlink) 錯誤。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:294
msgid "Copy metadata when *symlinks* is false. Now returns *dst*."
msgstr "當 *symlinks* 為 false 時複製詮釋資料。現在會回傳 *dst*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:303
msgid "Added the *dirs_exist_ok* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *dirs_exist_ok* 參數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:310
msgid ""
"Delete an entire directory tree; *path* must point to a directory (but not a "
"symbolic link to a directory).  If *ignore_errors* is true, errors resulting "
"from failed removals will be ignored; if false or omitted, such errors are "
"handled by calling a handler specified by *onexc* or *onerror* or, if both "
"are omitted, exceptions are propagated to the caller."
msgstr ""
"刪除整個目錄樹；*path* 必須指向一個目錄（但不能是指向目錄的符號連結）。如果 "
"*ignore_errors* 為 true，因刪除失敗而產生的錯誤將被忽略；如果為 false 或省"
"略，則會呼叫 *onexc* 或 *onerror* 所指定的處理函式來處理這類錯誤，若兩者皆省"
"略，則例外會被傳播給呼叫者。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:316
msgid ""
"If *path* is a symbolic link to a directory followed by a trailing path "
"separator, such as ``'link/'``, the operating system resolves the link, so :"
"func:`!rmtree` deletes the contents of the directory it points to and then "
"fails to remove *path* itself.  :class:`pathlib.Path` strips trailing "
"separators, so ``rmtree(Path('link/'))`` refuses the link as usual."
msgstr ""
"如果 *path* 是指向目錄的符號連結，且後面接著尾隨的路徑分隔符號，例如 "
"``'link/'``，作業系統會解析該連結，因此 :func:`!rmtree` 會刪除它所指向之目錄"
"的內容，接著無法移除 *path* 本身。:class:`pathlib.Path` 會去除尾隨的分隔符"
"號，因此 ``rmtree(Path('link/'))`` 會照常拒絕該連結。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:322
msgid ""
"This function can support :ref:`paths relative to directory descriptors "
"<dir_fd>`."
msgstr "此函式可以支援\\ :ref:`相對於目錄描述器的路徑 <dir_fd>`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:327
msgid ""
"On platforms that support the necessary fd-based functions a symlink attack "
"resistant version of :func:`rmtree` is used by default.  On other platforms, "
"the :func:`rmtree` implementation is susceptible to a symlink attack: given "
"proper timing and circumstances, attackers can manipulate symlinks on the "
"filesystem to delete files they wouldn't be able to access otherwise.  "
"Applications can use the :data:`rmtree.avoids_symlink_attacks` function "
"attribute to determine which case applies."
msgstr ""
"在支援必要的、以檔案描述器為基礎 (fd-based) 之函式的平台上，預設會使用能抵禦"
"符號連結攻擊 (symlink attack) 的 :func:`rmtree` 版本。在其他平台上，:func:"
"`rmtree` 的實作容易受到符號連結攻擊：在適當的時機與情況下，攻擊者可以操縱檔案"
"系統上的符號連結，刪除他們原本無權存取的檔案。應用程式可以使用 :data:`rmtree."
"avoids_symlink_attacks` 函式屬性來判斷適用哪種情況。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:335
msgid ""
"If *onexc* is provided, it must be a callable that accepts three parameters: "
"*function*, *path*, and *excinfo*."
msgstr ""
"如果有提供 *onexc*，它必須是一個接受三個參數的可呼叫物件：*function*、*path* "
"與 *excinfo*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:338
msgid ""
"The first parameter, *function*, is the function which raised the exception; "
"it depends on the platform and implementation.  The second parameter, "
"*path*, will be the path name passed to *function*.  The third parameter, "
"*excinfo*, is the exception that was raised. Exceptions raised by *onexc* "
"will not be caught."
msgstr ""
"第一個參數 *function* 是引發例外的函式；它取決於平台與實作。第二個參數 "
"*path* 是傳給 *function* 的路徑名稱。第三個參數 *excinfo* 是被引發的例外。由 "
"*onexc* 引發的例外不會被捕捉。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:344
msgid ""
"The deprecated *onerror* is similar to *onexc*, except that the third "
"parameter it receives is the tuple returned from :func:`sys.exc_info`."
msgstr ""
"已棄用的 *onerror* 與 *onexc* 類似，差別在於它接收的第三個參數是 :func:`sys."
"exc_info` 回傳的 tuple。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:348
msgid ""
":ref:`shutil-rmtree-example` for an example of handling the removal of a "
"directory tree that contains read-only files."
msgstr ""
"關於如何刪除包含唯讀檔案的目錄樹，請參閱 :ref:`shutil-rmtree-example`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:351
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.rmtree`` with arguments "
"``path``, ``dir_fd``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``path``、``dir_fd`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` "
"``shutil.rmtree``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:353
msgid ""
"Added a symlink attack resistant version that is used automatically if "
"platform supports fd-based functions."
msgstr ""
"新增能抵禦符號連結攻擊的版本，若平台支援以檔案描述器為基礎的函式，就會自動使"
"用該版本。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:357
msgid ""
"On Windows, will no longer delete the contents of a directory junction "
"before removing the junction."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，移除目錄聯接點 (junction) 之前不會再刪除其內容。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:361
msgid "Added the *dir_fd* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *dir_fd* 參數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:364
msgid "Added the *onexc* parameter, deprecated *onerror*."
msgstr "新增 *onexc* 參數並棄用 *onerror*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:367
msgid ""
":func:`!rmtree` now ignores :exc:`FileNotFoundError` exceptions for all but "
"the top-level path. Exceptions other than :exc:`OSError` and subclasses of :"
"exc:`!OSError` are now always propagated to the caller."
msgstr ""
":func:`!rmtree` 現在除了頂層路徑之外，會忽略所有 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 例"
"外。:exc:`OSError` 及 :exc:`!OSError` 子類別以外的例外，現在一律會傳播給呼叫"
"者。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:375
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the current platform and implementation provides a symlink "
"attack resistant version of :func:`rmtree`.  Currently this is only true for "
"platforms supporting fd-based directory access functions."
msgstr ""
"表示目前的平台與實作是否提供能抵禦符號連結攻擊的 :func:`rmtree` 版本。目前只"
"有在支援以檔案描述器為基礎之目錄存取函式的平台上才為 true。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:384
msgid ""
"Recursively move a file or directory (*src*) to another location and return "
"the destination."
msgstr "遞迴地將檔案或目錄 (*src*) 移動到另一個位置並回傳目的地。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:387
msgid ""
"If *dst* is an existing directory or a symlink to a directory, then *src* is "
"moved inside that directory. The destination path in that directory must not "
"already exist."
msgstr ""
"如果 *dst* 是已存在的目錄或指向目錄的符號連結，則 *src* 會被移到該目錄中。該"
"目錄中的目的路徑必須尚未存在。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:391
msgid ""
"If *dst* already exists but is not a directory, it may be overwritten "
"depending on :func:`os.rename` semantics."
msgstr ""
"如果 *dst* 已經存在但不是目錄，它可能會依 :func:`os.rename` 的語意被覆寫。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:394
msgid ""
":func:`os.rename` is preferably used internally when *src* and the "
"destination are on the same filesystem. In case :func:`os.rename` fails due "
"to :exc:`OSError` (e.g. the user has write permission to the destination "
"file but not to its parent directory), this method falls back to using "
"*copy_function*, in which case *src* is copied to the destination using "
"*copy_function* and then removed."
msgstr ""
"當 *src* 與目的地位於同一個檔案系統上時，內部會優先使用 :func:`os.rename`。如"
"果 :func:`os.rename` 因 :exc:`OSError` 而失敗（例如使用者對目的檔案有寫入權"
"限，但對其父目錄沒有），此方法會改用 *copy_function*，在這種情況下，*src* 會"
"使用 *copy_function* 複製到目的地，然後被移除。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:400
msgid ""
"In case of symlinks, a new symlink pointing to the target of *src* will be "
"created in or as the destination, and *src* will be removed."
msgstr ""
"對於符號連結，會在目的地中（或作為目的地）建立一個指向 *src* 目標的新符號連"
"結，並移除 *src*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:403
msgid ""
"If *copy_function* is given, it must be a callable that takes two arguments, "
"*src* and the destination, and will be used to copy *src* to the destination "
"if :func:`os.rename` cannot be used.  If the source is a directory, :func:"
"`copytree` is called, passing it the *copy_function*. The default "
"*copy_function* is :func:`copy2`.  Using :func:`~shutil.copy` as the "
"*copy_function* allows the move to succeed when it is not possible to also "
"copy the metadata, at the expense of not copying any of the metadata."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定 *copy_function*，它必須是一個接受兩個引數（*src* 與目的地）的可呼"
"叫物件，並會在無法使用 :func:`os.rename` 時用來將 *src* 複製到目的地。如果來"
"源是目錄，則會呼叫 :func:`copytree` 並將 *copy_function* 傳給它。預設的 "
"*copy_function* 是 :func:`copy2`。使用 :func:`~shutil.copy` 作為 "
"*copy_function*，可以在無法一併複製詮釋資料時讓移動成功，代價是不會複製任何詮"
"釋資料。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:411
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.move`` with arguments "
"``src``, ``dst``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``src``、``dst`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil."
"move``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:413
msgid ""
"Added explicit symlink handling for foreign filesystems, thus adapting it to "
"the behavior of GNU's :program:`mv`. Now returns *dst*."
msgstr ""
"新增跨檔案系統移動時對符號連結的明確處理，使其行為與 GNU 的 :program:`mv` 一"
"致。現在會回傳 *dst*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:418
msgid "Added the *copy_function* keyword argument."
msgstr "新增 *copy_function* 關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:426
msgid "Accepts a :term:`path-like object` for both *src* and *dst*."
msgstr "*src* 與 *dst* 皆接受\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:431
msgid ""
"Return disk usage statistics about the given path as a :term:`named tuple` "
"with the attributes *total*, *used* and *free*, which are the amount of "
"total, used and free space, in bytes. *path* may be a file or a directory."
msgstr ""
"以\\ :term:`附名元組 <named tuple>`\\ 回傳給定路徑的磁碟使用量統計資料，其屬"
"性有 *total*、*used* 與 *free*，分別為總空間、已使用空間與可用空間的量，以位"
"元組為單位。*path* 可以是檔案或目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:438
msgid ""
"On Unix filesystems, *path* must point to a path within a **mounted** "
"filesystem partition. On those platforms, CPython doesn't attempt to "
"retrieve disk usage information from non-mounted filesystems."
msgstr ""
"在 Unix 檔案系統上，*path* 必須指向一個位於\\ **已掛載**\\ 檔案系統分割區內的"
"路徑。在這些平台上，CPython 不會嘗試從未掛載的檔案系統取得磁碟使用量資訊。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:444
msgid "On Windows, *path* can now be a file or directory."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，*path* 現在可以是檔案或目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:447 ../../library/shutil.rst:461
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "可用性"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:452
msgid "Change owner *user* and/or *group* of the given *path*."
msgstr "變更給定 *path* 的擁有者 *user* 和/或群組 *group*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:454
msgid ""
"*user* can be a system user name or a uid; the same applies to *group*. At "
"least one argument is required."
msgstr ""
"*user* 可以是系統使用者名稱或 uid；*group* 也是如此。至少需要一個引數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:457
msgid "See also :func:`os.chown`, the underlying function."
msgstr "另請參閱 :func:`os.chown`，它是底層函式。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:459
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.chown`` with arguments "
"``path``, ``user``, ``group``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``path``、``user``、``group`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 "
"<auditing>` ``shutil.chown``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:465
msgid "Added *dir_fd* and *follow_symlinks* parameters."
msgstr "新增 *dir_fd* 和 *follow_symlinks* 參數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:471
msgid ""
"Return the path to an executable which would be run if the given *cmd* was "
"called.  If no *cmd* would be called, return ``None``."
msgstr ""
"回傳在呼叫給定的 *cmd* 時會被執行的可執行檔路徑。如果沒有任何 *cmd* 會被呼"
"叫，則回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:474
msgid ""
"*mode* is a permission mask passed to :func:`os.access`, by default "
"determining if the file exists and is executable."
msgstr ""
"*mode* 是傳給 :func:`os.access` 的權限遮罩，預設會判斷檔案是否存在且可執行。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:477
msgid ""
"*path* is a \"``PATH`` string\" specifying the directories to look in, "
"delimited by :data:`os.pathsep`. When no *path* is specified, the :envvar:"
"`PATH` environment variable is read from :data:`os.environ`, falling back "
"to :data:`os.defpath` if it is not set."
msgstr ""
"*path* 是一個「``PATH`` 字串」，指定要搜尋的目錄，以 :data:`os.pathsep` 分"
"隔。未指定 *path* 時，會從 :data:`os.environ` 讀取 :envvar:`PATH` 環境變數，"
"若該變數未設定則改用 :data:`os.defpath`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:482
msgid ""
"If *cmd* contains a directory component, :func:`!which` only checks the "
"specified path directly and does not search the directories listed in *path* "
"or in the system's :envvar:`PATH` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"如果 *cmd* 包含目錄部分，:func:`!which` 只會直接檢查指定的路徑，而不會搜尋 "
"*path* 或系統 :envvar:`PATH` 環境變數中所列出的目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:486
msgid ""
"On Windows, the current directory is prepended to the *path* if *mode* does "
"not include ``os.X_OK``. When the *mode* does include ``os.X_OK``, the "
"Windows API ``NeedCurrentDirectoryForExePathW`` will be consulted to "
"determine if the current directory should be prepended to *path*. To avoid "
"consulting the current working directory for executables: set the "
"environment variable ``NoDefaultCurrentDirectoryInExePath``."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，如果 *mode* 不包含 ``os.X_OK``，目前目錄會被加到 *path* 的前"
"面。當 *mode* 包含 ``os.X_OK`` 時，會查詢 Windows API "
"``NeedCurrentDirectoryForExePathW`` 來判斷是否應將目前目錄加到 *path* 前面。"
"若要避免在目前工作目錄中尋找可執行檔，請設定環境變數 "
"``NoDefaultCurrentDirectoryInExePath``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:493
msgid ""
"Also on Windows, the :envvar:`PATHEXT` environment variable is used to "
"resolve commands that may not already include an extension. For example, if "
"you call ``shutil.which(\"python\")``, :func:`which` will search ``PATHEXT`` "
"to know that it should look for ``python.exe`` within the *path* "
"directories. For example, on Windows::"
msgstr ""
"同樣在 Windows 上，會使用 :envvar:`PATHEXT` 環境變數來解析可能尚未包含副檔名"
"的命令。例如，如果你呼叫 ``shutil.which(\"python\")``，:func:`which` 會搜尋 "
"``PATHEXT``，得知它應該在 *path* 目錄中尋找 ``python.exe``。例如在 Windows "
"上： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:499
msgid ""
">>> shutil.which(\"python\")\n"
"'C:\\\\Python33\\\\python.EXE'"
msgstr ""
">>> shutil.which(\"python\")\n"
"'C:\\\\Python33\\\\python.EXE'"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:502
msgid ""
"This is also applied when *cmd* is a path that contains a directory "
"component::"
msgstr "當 *cmd* 是包含目錄部分的路徑時，這也同樣適用： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:505
msgid ""
">>> shutil.which(\"C:\\\\Python33\\\\python\")\n"
"'C:\\\\Python33\\\\python.EXE'"
msgstr ""
">>> shutil.which(\"C:\\\\Python33\\\\python\")\n"
"'C:\\\\Python33\\\\python.EXE'"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:510
msgid ""
"The :class:`bytes` type is now accepted.  If *cmd* type is :class:`bytes`, "
"the result type is also :class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
"現在接受 :class:`bytes` 型別。如果 *cmd* 的型別是 :class:`bytes`，結果的型別"
"也會是 :class:`bytes`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:514
msgid ""
"On Windows, the current directory is no longer prepended to the search path "
"if *mode* includes ``os.X_OK`` and WinAPI "
"``NeedCurrentDirectoryForExePathW(cmd)`` is false, else the current "
"directory is prepended even if it is already in the search path; ``PATHEXT`` "
"is used now even when *cmd* includes a directory component or ends with an "
"extension that is in ``PATHEXT``; and filenames that have no extension can "
"now be found."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，如果 *mode* 包含 ``os.X_OK`` 且 WinAPI "
"``NeedCurrentDirectoryForExePathW(cmd)`` 為 false，目前目錄就不再被加到搜尋路"
"徑的前面，否則即使目前目錄已在搜尋路徑中，仍會將其加到前面；現在即使 *cmd* 包"
"含目錄部分或以 ``PATHEXT`` 中的副檔名結尾，也會使用 ``PATHEXT``；並且現在可以"
"找到沒有副檔名的檔案名稱。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:525
msgid ""
"Subclass of :exc:`OSError` collecting exceptions raised during a multi-file "
"operation. For :func:`copytree`, the exception argument is a list of 3-"
"tuples (*srcname*, *dstname*, *exception*)."
msgstr ""
":exc:`OSError` 的子類別，收集在多檔案操作期間引發的例外。對於 :func:"
"`copytree`，例外引數是一個由 3-tuple (*srcname*, *dstname*, *exception*) 組成"
"的串列。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:532
msgid "Platform-dependent efficient copy operations"
msgstr "平台相依的高效率複製操作"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:534
msgid ""
"Starting from Python 3.8, all functions involving a file copy (:func:"
"`copyfile`, :func:`~shutil.copy`, :func:`copy2`, :func:`copytree`, and :func:"
"`move`) may use platform-specific \"fast-copy\" syscalls in order to copy "
"the file more efficiently (see :issue:`33671`). \"fast-copy\" means that the "
"copying operation occurs within the kernel, avoiding the use of userspace "
"buffers in Python as in \"``outfd.write(infd.read())``\"."
msgstr ""
"從 Python 3.8 開始，所有涉及檔案複製的函式（:func:`copyfile`、:func:`~shutil."
"copy`、:func:`copy2`、:func:`copytree` 與 :func:`move`）都可能使用平台特定的"
"「快速複製」系統呼叫，以更有效率地複製檔案（請參閱 :issue:`33671`）。「快速複"
"製」代表複製操作會在核心內進行，避免像「``outfd.write(infd.read())``」那樣在 "
"Python 中使用使用者空間的緩衝區。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:542
msgid "On macOS `fcopyfile`_ is used to copy the file content (not metadata)."
msgstr "macOS 上會使用 `fcopyfile`_ 來複製檔案內容（不含詮釋資料）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:544
msgid "On Linux :func:`os.copy_file_range` or :func:`os.sendfile` is used."
msgstr "Linux 上會使用 :func:`os.copy_file_range` 或 :func:`os.sendfile`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:546
msgid "On Solaris :func:`os.sendfile` is used."
msgstr "Solaris 上會使用 :func:`os.sendfile`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:548
msgid ""
"On Windows :func:`shutil.copyfile` uses a bigger default buffer size (1 MiB "
"instead of 64 KiB) and a :func:`memoryview`-based variant of :func:`shutil."
"copyfileobj` is used, which still reads and writes in a loop. :func:`shutil."
"copy2` uses the native ``CopyFile2`` call on Windows, which is the most "
"efficient method, supports copy-on-write, and preserves metadata."
msgstr ""
"Windows 上的 :func:`shutil.copyfile` 會使用較大的預設緩衝區大小（1 MiB 而非 "
"64 KiB），並使用以 :func:`memoryview` 為基礎的 :func:`shutil.copyfileobj` 變"
"體，它仍是以迴圈方式讀取與寫入。:func:`shutil.copy2` 在 Windows 上使用原生的 "
"``CopyFile2`` 呼叫，這是最有效率的方法，支援寫入時複製 (copy-on-write)，並會"
"保留詮釋資料。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:554
msgid ""
"If the fast-copy operation fails and no data was written in the destination "
"file then shutil will silently fall back to less efficient :func:"
"`copyfileobj` function internally."
msgstr ""
"如果快速複製操作失敗且沒有任何資料寫入目的檔案，shutil 會在內部靜默地改用效率"
"較低的 :func:`copyfileobj` 函式。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:560
msgid "Solaris now uses :func:`os.sendfile`."
msgstr "Solaris 現在會使用 :func:`os.sendfile`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:563
msgid ""
"Copy-on-write or server-side copy may be used internally via :func:`os."
"copy_file_range` on supported Linux filesystems."
msgstr ""
"在支援的 Linux 檔案系統上，內部可能會透過 :func:`os.copy_file_range` 使用寫入"
"時複製或伺服器端複製。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:570
msgid "copytree example"
msgstr "copytree 範例"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:572
msgid "An example that uses the :func:`ignore_patterns` helper::"
msgstr "一個使用 :func:`ignore_patterns` 輔助函式的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:574
msgid ""
"from shutil import copytree, ignore_patterns\n"
"\n"
"copytree(source, destination, ignore=ignore_patterns('*.pyc', 'tmp*'))"
msgstr ""
"from shutil import copytree, ignore_patterns\n"
"\n"
"copytree(source, destination, ignore=ignore_patterns('*.pyc', 'tmp*'))"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:578
msgid ""
"This will copy everything except ``.pyc`` files and files or directories "
"whose name starts with ``tmp``."
msgstr ""
"這會複製所有內容，除了 ``.pyc`` 檔案以及名稱以 ``tmp`` 開頭的檔案或目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:581
msgid "Another example that uses the *ignore* argument to add a logging call::"
msgstr "另一個使用 *ignore* 引數來加入日誌記錄呼叫的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:583
msgid ""
"from shutil import copytree\n"
"import logging\n"
"\n"
"def _logpath(path, names):\n"
"    logging.info('Working in %s', path)\n"
"    return []   # nothing will be ignored\n"
"\n"
"copytree(source, destination, ignore=_logpath)"
msgstr ""
"from shutil import copytree\n"
"import logging\n"
"\n"
"def _logpath(path, names):\n"
"    logging.info('Working in %s', path)\n"
"    return []   # 沒有東西被忽略\n"
"\n"
"copytree(source, destination, ignore=_logpath)"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:596
msgid "rmtree example"
msgstr "rmtree 範例"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:598
msgid ""
"This example shows how to remove a directory tree on Windows where some of "
"the files have their read-only bit set. It uses the onexc callback to clear "
"the readonly bit and reattempt the remove. Any subsequent failure will "
"propagate. ::"
msgstr ""
"此範例展示如何在 Windows 上刪除目錄樹，其中部分檔案設定了唯讀位元。它使用 "
"onexc 回呼來清除唯讀位元並重新嘗試刪除。任何後續的失敗都會被傳播。 ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:603
msgid ""
"import os, stat\n"
"import shutil\n"
"\n"
"def remove_readonly(func, path, _):\n"
"    \"Clear the readonly bit and reattempt the removal\"\n"
"    os.chmod(path, stat.S_IWRITE)\n"
"    func(path)\n"
"\n"
"shutil.rmtree(directory, onexc=remove_readonly)"
msgstr ""
"import os, stat\n"
"import shutil\n"
"\n"
"def remove_readonly(func, path, _):\n"
"    \"Clear the readonly bit and reattempt the removal\"\n"
"    os.chmod(path, stat.S_IWRITE)\n"
"    func(path)\n"
"\n"
"shutil.rmtree(directory, onexc=remove_readonly)"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:616
msgid "Archiving operations"
msgstr "封存操作"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:620
msgid "Added support for the *xztar* format."
msgstr "新增 *xztar* 格式的支援。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:624
msgid ""
"High-level utilities to create and read compressed and archived files are "
"also provided.  They rely on the :mod:`zipfile` and :mod:`tarfile` modules."
msgstr ""
"也提供了建立與讀取壓縮檔及封存檔的高階工具。它們依賴 :mod:`zipfile` 與 :mod:"
"`tarfile` 模組。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:629
msgid "Create an archive file (such as zip or tar) and return its name."
msgstr "建立一個封存檔（例如 zip 或 tar）並回傳其名稱。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:631
msgid ""
"*base_name* is a string or :term:`path-like object` specifying the name of "
"the file to create, including the path, minus any format-specific extension."
msgstr ""
"*base_name* 是一個字串或\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`，指定要建立"
"的檔案名稱，包括路徑，但不含任何格式特定的副檔名。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:634
msgid ""
"*format* is the archive format: one of \"zip\" (if the :mod:`zlib` module is "
"available), \"tar\", \"gztar\" (if the :mod:`zlib` module is available), "
"\"bztar\" (if the :mod:`bz2` module is available), \"xztar\" (if the :mod:"
"`lzma` module is available), or \"zstdtar\" (if the :mod:`compression.zstd` "
"module is available)."
msgstr ""
"*format* 是封存格式：\"zip\"（如果 :mod:`zlib` 模組可"
"用）、\"tar\"、\"gztar\"（如果 :mod:`zlib` 模組可用）、\"bztar\"（如果 :mod:"
"`bz2` 模組可用）、\"xztar\"（如果 :mod:`lzma` 模組可用）或 \"zstdtar\"（如"
"果 :mod:`compression.zstd` 模組可用）其中之一。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:640
msgid ""
"*root_dir* is a string or :term:`path-like object` specifying a directory "
"that will be the root directory of the archive, all paths in the archive "
"will be relative to it; for example, we typically chdir into *root_dir* "
"before creating the archive."
msgstr ""
"*root_dir* 是一個字串或\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`，指定將作為封"
"存檔根目錄的目錄，封存檔中的所有路徑都將相對於它；例如，通常會先 chdir 進入 "
"*root_dir* 再建立封存檔。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:645
msgid ""
"*base_dir* is a string or :term:`path-like object` specifying a directory "
"where we start archiving from; i.e. *base_dir* will be the common prefix of "
"all files and directories in the archive.  *base_dir* must be given relative "
"to *root_dir*.  See :ref:`shutil-archiving-example-with-basedir` for how to "
"use *base_dir* and *root_dir* together."
msgstr ""
"*base_dir* 是一個字串或\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`，指定開始封存"
"的目錄；也就是說，*base_dir* 將是封存檔中所有檔案與目錄的共同前綴。"
"*base_dir* 必須以相對於 *root_dir* 的方式給定。關於如何同時使用 *base_dir* "
"與 *root_dir*，請參閱\\ :ref:`shutil-archiving-example-with-basedir`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:651
msgid "*root_dir* and *base_dir* both default to the current directory."
msgstr "*root_dir* 與 *base_dir* 的預設值皆為目前目錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:653
msgid ""
"If *dry_run* is true, no archive is created, but the operations that would "
"be executed are logged to *logger*."
msgstr ""
"如果 *dry_run* 為 true，則不會建立封存檔，但會將原本會執行的操作記錄到 "
"*logger*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:656
msgid ""
"*owner* and *group* are used when creating a tar archive. By default, uses "
"the current owner and group."
msgstr ""
"*owner* 與 *group* 會在建立 tar 封存檔時使用。預設會使用目前的擁有者與群組。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:659
msgid ""
"*logger* must be an object compatible with :pep:`282`, usually an instance "
"of :class:`logging.Logger`."
msgstr ""
"*logger* 必須是與 :pep:`282` 相容的物件，通常是 :class:`logging.Logger` 的實"
"例。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:662
msgid "The *verbose* argument is unused and deprecated."
msgstr "*verbose* 引數未被使用且已棄用。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:664
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.make_archive`` with "
"arguments ``base_name``, ``format``, ``root_dir``, ``base_dir``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``base_name``、``format``、``root_dir``、``base_dir`` 的\\ :"
"ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``shutil.make_archive``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:668
msgid ""
"This function is not thread-safe when custom archivers registered with :func:"
"`register_archive_format` do not support the *root_dir* argument.  In this "
"case it temporarily changes the current working directory of the process to "
"*root_dir* to perform archiving."
msgstr ""
"當透過 :func:`register_archive_format` 註冊的自訂封存器不支援 *root_dir* 引數"
"時，此函式不是執行緒安全的。在這種情況下，它會暫時將行程的目前工作目錄變更為 "
"*root_dir* 以執行封存。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:674
msgid ""
"The modern pax (POSIX.1-2001) format is now used instead of the legacy GNU "
"format for archives created with ``format=\"tar\"``."
msgstr ""
"以 ``format=\"tar\"`` 建立的封存檔，現在會使用現代的 pax (POSIX.1-2001) 格"
"式，而不是舊有的 GNU 格式。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:678
msgid ""
"This function is now made thread-safe during creation of standard ``.zip`` "
"and tar archives."
msgstr "此函式現在在建立標準 ``.zip`` 與 tar 封存檔時是執行緒安全的。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:682
msgid ""
"Accepts a :term:`path-like object` for *base_name*, *root_dir* and "
"*base_dir*."
msgstr ""
"*base_name*、*root_dir* 與 *base_dir* 接受\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like "
"object>`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:688
msgid ""
"Return a list of supported formats for archiving. Each element of the "
"returned sequence is a tuple ``(name, description)``."
msgstr ""
"回傳支援封存的格式串列。回傳序列中的每個元素都是一個 tuple ``(name, "
"description)``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:691 ../../library/shutil.rst:808
msgid "By default :mod:`!shutil` provides these formats:"
msgstr "預設情況下 :mod:`!shutil` 提供這些格式："

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:693
msgid "*zip*: ZIP file (if the :mod:`zlib` module is available)."
msgstr "*zip*：ZIP 檔案（如果 :mod:`zlib` 模組可用）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:694
msgid ""
"*tar*: Uncompressed tar file. Uses POSIX.1-2001 pax format for new archives."
msgstr "*tar*：未壓縮的 tar 檔案。新的封存檔會使用 POSIX.1-2001 pax 格式。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:695 ../../library/shutil.rst:813
msgid "*gztar*: gzip'ed tar-file (if the :mod:`zlib` module is available)."
msgstr "*gztar*：以 gzip 壓縮的 tar 檔案（如果 :mod:`zlib` 模組可用）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:696 ../../library/shutil.rst:814
msgid "*bztar*: bzip2'ed tar-file (if the :mod:`bz2` module is available)."
msgstr "*bztar*：以 bzip2 壓縮的 tar 檔案（如果 :mod:`bz2` 模組可用）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:697 ../../library/shutil.rst:815
msgid "*xztar*: xz'ed tar-file (if the :mod:`lzma` module is available)."
msgstr "*xztar*：以 xz 壓縮的 tar 檔案（如果 :mod:`lzma` 模組可用）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:698 ../../library/shutil.rst:816
msgid ""
"*zstdtar*: Zstandard compressed tar-file (if the :mod:`compression.zstd` "
"module is available)."
msgstr ""
"*zstdtar*：以 Zstandard 壓縮的 tar 檔案（如果 :mod:`compression.zstd` 模組可"
"用）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:701
msgid ""
"You can register new formats or provide your own archiver for any existing "
"formats, by using :func:`register_archive_format`."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用 :func:`register_archive_format` 來註冊新的格式，或為任何既有格式提"
"供你自己的封存器。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:707
msgid "Register an archiver for the format *name*."
msgstr "為格式 *name* 註冊一個封存器。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:709
msgid ""
"*function* is the callable that will be used to create archives. The "
"callable will receive the *base_name* of the file to create, followed by the "
"*base_dir* (which defaults to :data:`os.curdir`) to start archiving from. "
"Further arguments are passed as keyword arguments: *owner*, *group*, "
"*dry_run* and *logger* (as passed in :func:`make_archive`)."
msgstr ""
"*function* 是用來建立封存檔的可呼叫物件。該可呼叫物件會接收要建立之檔案的 "
"*base_name*，接著是開始封存的 *base_dir*\\ （預設為 :data:`os.curdir`）。其他"
"引數會以關鍵字引數傳入：*owner*、*group*、*dry_run* 與 *logger*\\ （如同傳"
"給 :func:`make_archive` 的值）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:715
msgid ""
"If *function* has the custom attribute ``function.supports_root_dir`` set to "
"``True``, the *root_dir* argument is passed as a keyword argument. Otherwise "
"the current working directory of the process is temporarily changed to "
"*root_dir* before calling *function*. In this case :func:`make_archive` is "
"not thread-safe."
msgstr ""
"如果 *function* 設有自訂屬性 ``function.supports_root_dir`` 且其值為 "
"``True``，*root_dir* 引數會以關鍵字引數傳入。否則，在呼叫 *function* 之前，行"
"程的目前工作目錄會暫時變更為 *root_dir*。在這種情況下，:func:`make_archive` "
"不是執行緒安全的。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:721
msgid ""
"If given, *extra_args* is a sequence of ``(name, value)`` pairs that will be "
"used as extra keywords arguments when the archiver callable is used."
msgstr ""
"*extra_args* 若有給定，則是一個由 ``(name, value)`` 對組成的序列，在使用封存"
"器可呼叫物件時會作為額外的關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:724
msgid ""
"*description* is used by :func:`get_archive_formats` which returns the list "
"of archivers.  Defaults to an empty string."
msgstr ""
"*description* 會被 :func:`get_archive_formats` 使用，該函式會回傳封存器的串"
"列。預設為空字串。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:727
msgid "Added support for functions supporting the *root_dir* argument."
msgstr "新增對支援 *root_dir* 引數之函式的支援。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:733
msgid "Remove the archive format *name* from the list of supported formats."
msgstr "從支援的格式串列中移除封存格式 *name*。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:738
msgid "Unpack an archive. *filename* is the full path of the archive."
msgstr "解壓縮封存檔。*filename* 是封存檔的完整路徑。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:740
msgid ""
"*extract_dir* is the name of the target directory where the archive is "
"unpacked. If not provided, the current working directory is used."
msgstr ""
"*extract_dir* 是封存檔要解壓縮到的目標目錄名稱。若未提供，則使用目前工作目"
"錄。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:743
msgid ""
"*format* is the archive format: one of \"zip\", \"tar\", \"gztar\", "
"\"bztar\", \"xztar\", or \"zstdtar\".  Or any other format registered with :"
"func:`register_unpack_format`.  If not provided, :func:`unpack_archive` will "
"use the archive file name extension and see if an unpacker was registered "
"for that extension.  In case none is found, a :exc:`ValueError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"*format* 是封存格式：\"zip\"、\"tar\"、\"gztar\"、\"bztar\"、\"xztar\" 或 "
"\"zstdtar\" 其中之一，或是任何以 :func:`register_unpack_format` 註冊的其他格"
"式。若未提供，:func:`unpack_archive` 會使用封存檔的副檔名，並查看是否有為該副"
"檔名註冊解壓縮器。若找不到任何解壓縮器，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:750
msgid ""
"The keyword-only *filter* argument is passed to the underlying unpacking "
"function. For zip files, *filter* is not accepted. For tar files, it is "
"recommended to use ``'data'`` (default since Python 3.14), unless using "
"features specific to tar and UNIX-like filesystems. (See :ref:`tarfile-"
"extraction-filter` for details.)"
msgstr ""
"僅限關鍵字的 *filter* 引數會被傳給底層的解壓縮函式。對於 zip 檔案，不接受 "
"*filter*。對於 tar 檔案，建議使用 ``'data'``\\ （自 Python 3.14 起為預設"
"值），除非有使用 tar 與類 UNIX 檔案系統特有的功能。（詳情請參閱\\ :ref:"
"`tarfile-extraction-filter`。）"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:756
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``shutil.unpack_archive`` with "
"arguments ``filename``, ``extract_dir``, ``format``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``filename``、``extract_dir``、``format`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事"
"件 <auditing>` ``shutil.unpack_archive``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:760
msgid ""
"Never extract archives from untrusted sources without prior inspection. It "
"is possible that files are created outside of the path specified in the "
"*extract_dir* argument, for example, members that have absolute filenames or "
"filenames with \"..\" components."
msgstr ""
"在未事先檢查的情況下，絕對不要解壓縮來自不受信任來源的封存檔。檔案有可能會被"
"建立在 *extract_dir* 引數所指定的路徑之外，例如具有絕對檔案名稱，或檔案名稱含"
"有 \"..\" 組成部分的成員。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:765
msgid ""
"Since Python 3.14, the defaults for both built-in formats (zip and tar "
"files) will prevent the most dangerous of such security issues, but will not "
"prevent *all* unintended behavior. Read the :ref:`tarfile-further-"
"verification` section for tar-specific details."
msgstr ""
"自 Python 3.14 起，兩種內建格式（zip 與 tar 檔案）的預設值會防止這類安全問題"
"中最危險的情況，但無法防止\\ *所有*\\ 非預期的行為。tar 特有的詳細資訊請閱讀"
"\\ :ref:`tarfile-further-verification`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:771
msgid "Accepts a :term:`path-like object` for *filename* and *extract_dir*."
msgstr ""
"*filename* 與 *extract_dir* 接受\\ :term:`類路徑物件 <path-like object>`。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:774
msgid "Added the *filter* argument."
msgstr "新增 *filter* 引數。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:779
msgid ""
"Registers an unpack format. *name* is the name of the format and "
"*extensions* is a list of extensions corresponding to the format, like ``."
"zip`` for Zip files."
msgstr ""
"註冊一個解壓縮格式。*name* 是格式的名稱，*extensions* 是對應該格式的副檔名串"
"列，例如 Zip 檔案的 ``.zip``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:783
msgid ""
"*function* is the callable that will be used to unpack archives. The "
"callable will receive:"
msgstr "*function* 是用來解壓縮封存檔的可呼叫物件。該可呼叫物件會接收："

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:786
msgid "the path of the archive, as a positional argument;"
msgstr "封存檔的路徑，作為位置引數；"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:787
msgid ""
"the directory the archive must be extracted to, as a positional argument;"
msgstr "封存檔必須解壓縮到的目錄，作為位置引數；"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:788
msgid ""
"possibly a *filter* keyword argument, if it was given to :func:"
"`unpack_archive`;"
msgstr ""
"可能還有一個 *filter* 關鍵字引數，如果有將它傳給 :func:`unpack_archive` 的"
"話；"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:790
msgid ""
"additional keyword arguments, specified by *extra_args* as a sequence of "
"``(name, value)`` tuples."
msgstr ""
"額外的關鍵字引數，由 *extra_args* 以 ``(name, value)`` tuple 的序列指定。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:793
msgid ""
"*description* can be provided to describe the format, and will be returned "
"by the :func:`get_unpack_formats` function."
msgstr ""
"可以提供 *description* 來描述該格式，它將由 :func:`get_unpack_formats` 函式回"
"傳。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:799
msgid "Unregister an unpack format. *name* is the name of the format."
msgstr "取消註冊一個解壓縮格式。*name* 是格式的名稱。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:804
msgid ""
"Return a list of all registered formats for unpacking. Each element of the "
"returned sequence is a tuple ``(name, extensions, description)``."
msgstr ""
"回傳所有已註冊之解壓縮格式的串列。回傳序列中的每個元素都是一個 tuple "
"``(name, extensions, description)``。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:810
msgid ""
"*zip*: ZIP file (unpacking compressed files works only if the corresponding "
"module is available)."
msgstr "*zip*：ZIP 檔案（只有在對應模組可用時，才能解壓縮經過壓縮的檔案）。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:812
msgid "*tar*: uncompressed tar file."
msgstr "*tar*：未壓縮的 tar 檔案。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:819
msgid ""
"You can register new formats or provide your own unpacker for any existing "
"formats, by using :func:`register_unpack_format`."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用 :func:`register_unpack_format` 來註冊新的格式，或為任何既有格式提"
"供你自己的解壓縮器。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:826
msgid "Archiving example"
msgstr "封存範例"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:828
msgid ""
"In this example, we create a gzip'ed tar-file archive containing all files "
"found in the :file:`.ssh` directory of the user::"
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，我們建立一個以 gzip 壓縮的 tar 封存檔，其中包含使用者 :file:`."
"ssh` 目錄中的所有檔案： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:831
msgid ""
">>> from shutil import make_archive\n"
">>> import os\n"
">>> archive_name = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', 'myarchive'))\n"
">>> root_dir = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', '.ssh'))\n"
">>> make_archive(archive_name, 'gztar', root_dir)\n"
"'/Users/tarek/myarchive.tar.gz'"
msgstr ""
">>> from shutil import make_archive\n"
">>> import os\n"
">>> archive_name = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', 'myarchive'))\n"
">>> root_dir = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', '.ssh'))\n"
">>> make_archive(archive_name, 'gztar', root_dir)\n"
"'/Users/tarek/myarchive.tar.gz'"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:838
msgid "The resulting archive contains:"
msgstr "產生的封存檔包含："

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:840
msgid ""
"$ tar -tzvf /Users/tarek/myarchive.tar.gz\n"
"drwx------ tarek/staff       0 2010-02-01 16:23:40 ./\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff     609 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./authorized_keys\n"
"-rwxr-xr-x tarek/staff      65 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./config\n"
"-rwx------ tarek/staff     668 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_dsa\n"
"-rwxr-xr-x tarek/staff     609 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_dsa.pub\n"
"-rw------- tarek/staff    1675 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_rsa\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff     397 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_rsa.pub\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff   37192 2010-02-06 18:23:10 ./known_hosts"
msgstr ""
"$ tar -tzvf /Users/tarek/myarchive.tar.gz\n"
"drwx------ tarek/staff       0 2010-02-01 16:23:40 ./\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff     609 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./authorized_keys\n"
"-rwxr-xr-x tarek/staff      65 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./config\n"
"-rwx------ tarek/staff     668 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_dsa\n"
"-rwxr-xr-x tarek/staff     609 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_dsa.pub\n"
"-rw------- tarek/staff    1675 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_rsa\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff     397 2008-06-09 13:26:54 ./id_rsa.pub\n"
"-rw-r--r-- tarek/staff   37192 2010-02-06 18:23:10 ./known_hosts"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:856
msgid "Archiving example with *base_dir*"
msgstr "使用 *base_dir* 的封存範例"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:858
msgid ""
"In this example, similar to the `one above <shutil-archiving-example_>`_, we "
"show how to use :func:`make_archive`, but this time with the usage of "
"*base_dir*.  We now have the following directory structure:"
msgstr ""
"此範例與\\ `上面的範例 <shutil-archiving-example_>`_\\ 類似，示範如何使用 :"
"func:`make_archive`，但這次會使用 *base_dir*。現在有以下的目錄結構："

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:862
msgid ""
"$ tree tmp\n"
"tmp\n"
"└── root\n"
"    └── structure\n"
"        ├── content\n"
"            └── please_add.txt\n"
"        └── do_not_add.txt"
msgstr ""
"$ tree tmp\n"
"tmp\n"
"└── root\n"
"    └── structure\n"
"        ├── content\n"
"            └── please_add.txt\n"
"        └── do_not_add.txt"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:872
msgid ""
"In the final archive, :file:`please_add.txt` should be included, but :file:"
"`do_not_add.txt` should not.  Therefore we use the following::"
msgstr ""
"最終的封存檔中應該包含 :file:`please_add.txt`，但不應包含 :file:`do_not_add."
"txt`。因此我們使用以下程式碼： ::"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:875
msgid ""
">>> from shutil import make_archive\n"
">>> import os\n"
">>> archive_name = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', 'myarchive'))\n"
">>> make_archive(\n"
"...     archive_name,\n"
"...     'tar',\n"
"...     root_dir='tmp/root',\n"
"...     base_dir='structure/content',\n"
"... )\n"
"'/Users/tarek/myarchive.tar'"
msgstr ""
">>> from shutil import make_archive\n"
">>> import os\n"
">>> archive_name = os.path.expanduser(os.path.join('~', 'myarchive'))\n"
">>> make_archive(\n"
"...     archive_name,\n"
"...     'tar',\n"
"...     root_dir='tmp/root',\n"
"...     base_dir='structure/content',\n"
"... )\n"
"'/Users/tarek/myarchive.tar'"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:886
msgid "Listing the files in the resulting archive gives us:"
msgstr "列出產生之封存檔中的檔案會得到："

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:888
msgid ""
"$ python -m tarfile -l /Users/tarek/myarchive.tar\n"
"structure/content/\n"
"structure/content/please_add.txt"
msgstr ""
"$ python -m tarfile -l /Users/tarek/myarchive.tar\n"
"structure/content/\n"
"structure/content/please_add.txt"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:896
msgid "Querying the size of the output terminal"
msgstr "查詢輸出終端機的大小"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:900
msgid "Get the size of the terminal window."
msgstr "取得終端機視窗的大小。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:902
msgid ""
"For each of the two dimensions, the environment variable, ``COLUMNS`` and "
"``LINES`` respectively, is checked. If the variable is defined and the value "
"is a positive integer, it is used."
msgstr ""
"對於這兩個維度，會分別檢查環境變數 ``COLUMNS`` 與 ``LINES``。如果變數有定義且"
"其值為正整數，就會使用該值。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:906
msgid ""
"When ``COLUMNS`` or ``LINES`` is not defined, which is the common case, the "
"terminal connected to :data:`sys.__stdout__` is queried by invoking :func:"
"`os.get_terminal_size`."
msgstr ""
"當 ``COLUMNS`` 或 ``LINES`` 未定義時（這是常見的情況），會透過呼叫 :func:`os."
"get_terminal_size` 來查詢連接到 :data:`sys.__stdout__` 的終端機。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:910
msgid ""
"If the terminal size cannot be successfully queried, either because the "
"system doesn't support querying, or because we are not connected to a "
"terminal, the value given in ``fallback`` parameter is used. ``fallback`` "
"defaults to ``(80, 24)`` which is the default size used by many terminal "
"emulators."
msgstr ""
"如果無法成功查詢終端機大小，無論是因為系統不支援查詢，或是因為未連接到終端"
"機，都會使用 ``fallback`` 參數中給定的值。``fallback`` 預設為 ``(80, 24)``，"
"這是許多終端機模擬器使用的預設大小。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:916
msgid "The value returned is a named tuple of type :class:`os.terminal_size`."
msgstr "回傳值是型別為 :class:`os.terminal_size` 的附名元組。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:918
msgid ""
"See also: The Single UNIX Specification, Version 2, `Other Environment "
"Variables`_."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱：The Single UNIX Specification 第 2 版中的\\ `其他環境變數 (Other "
"Environment Variables) <Other Environment Variables_>`_。"

#: ../../library/shutil.rst:923
msgid ""
"The ``fallback`` values are also used if :func:`os.get_terminal_size` "
"returns zeroes."
msgstr "如果 :func:`os.get_terminal_size` 回傳零，也會使用 ``fallback`` 值。"

